      "id": "exam/edexcel-9ma0-01-2023-june/q2",
      "question": "<p><strong>In this question you must show all stages of your working.</strong></p><p><strong>Solutions relying entirely on calculator technology are not acceptable.</strong></p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(x)=4x^3+5x^2-10x+4a\\qquad x\\in\\mathbb R\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span> is a positive constant.</p><p>Given <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(x-a)\"></span> is a factor of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(x)\"></span>,</p><ol class=\"parts\"><li>show that<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"a\\left(4a^2+5a-6\\right)=0\" data-display=\"true\"></div><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li><li>Hence<ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li>find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span></li><li>use algebra to find the exact solutions of the equation<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(x)=3\" data-display=\"true\"></div></li></ol><span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></li></ol>",
