      "id": "exam/edexcel-9ma0-01-2023-june/q7",
      "question": "<p>The function <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f\"></span> is defined by</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(x)=3+\\sqrt{x-2}\\qquad x\\in\\mathbb R\\quad x&gt;2\" data-display=\"true\"></div><ol class=\"parts\"><li>State the range of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(1)</span></li><li>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f^{-1}\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li></ol><p>The function <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm g\"></span> is defined by</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm g(x)=\\frac{15}{x-3}\\qquad x\\in\\mathbb R\\quad x\\neq3\" data-display=\"true\"></div><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"3\"><li>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm{gf}(6)\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li><li>Find the exact value of the constant <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span> for which<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f\\left(a^2+2\\right)=\\mathrm g(a)\" data-display=\"true\"></div><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol>",
