    {
      "id": "exam/edexcel-9ma0-01-2023-june/q10",
      "question": "<p>A circle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span> has equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^2+y^2+6kx-2ky+7=0\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span> is a constant.</p><ol class=\"parts\"><li>Find in terms of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span>,<ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li>the coordinates of the centre of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span></li><li>the radius of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span></li></ol><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li></ol><p>The line with equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2x-1\"></span> intersects <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span> at 2 distinct points.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"2\"><li>Find the range of possible values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(6)</span></li></ol>",
